Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing a birthday party.\NYou should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:08.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're kinda easy to talk to lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did decide not to lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laters!\NSee you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is where I last saw Hinazuki 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.93,0:00:34.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her body was only found\Nafter the snow melted,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:38.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but she went missing sometime in March. What day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I can figure that out,\NI can prevent her kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nakanishi Aya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:49.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sugita Hiromi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.94,0:00:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, Hiromi was killed, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.78,0:00:53.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But only Hinazuki was ten years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:58.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So her birthday hadn't yet passed\Nwhen she went missing in March.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means that X-Day is somewhere\Nbetween March 1st and her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.76,0:02:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently the boys are competing in pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.48,0:02:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:51.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet Hamada's gonna get the best time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:52.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hamada-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:57.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ice hockey team, represent!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:02:57.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kick some butt, Hamada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:02:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:02:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Show 'em who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to go easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.01,0:03:09.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hamada's a starter on the ice hockey team\Nthat won the national championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:14.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do remember racing him at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma's going up against Hamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.91,0:03:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:23.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wish him luck, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go on, Hinazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:30.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think you can win, Fujinuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:36.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On your marks...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:42.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get set...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:51.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Satoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, Hamada?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:56.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.89,0:03:58.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma must've jumped the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I really allowed to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.03,0:04:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is there any point to me winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy does his best and practices hard every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's obvious who should win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.36,0:04:21.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Score!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See? Hamada did win in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:27.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru pushed Hamada\Nall the way! That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, Kenya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:36.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujinuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate punks like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:46.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.98,0:04:48.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was a close one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.04,0:04:48.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:50.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously. Getting mad just 'cause he nearly lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:57.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate punks like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ended up making the same\Nmistake I made 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.69,0:05:17.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up, Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.35,0:05:21.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hamada was too fast for me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.79,0:05:23.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:24.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:26.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When's your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.01,0:05:31.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:37.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said you wouldn't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.\NI felt like today was meant to be Hamada's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.13,0:05:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:46.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:52.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're both fakes and liars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's head home, Satoru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot something. Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.33,0:06:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yashiro-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:33.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this about Kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:38.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's got good intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:46.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've become good friends with her lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't ask her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told her when my birthday was,\Nbut she wouldn't tell me hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:57.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What exactly do you "get"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:03.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The same birthday as me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.71,0:07:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:07.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Kayo's a bit shy, so she probably found\Nit hard to mention you shared birthdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't let that get to you, though.\NCelebrate it with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:19.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.84,0:07:24.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Too bad about the race today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:27.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, always give it your all.\NThe same goes with Kayo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:29.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:31.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yashiro Gaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He must be around my age at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:36.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's got a sharp, discerning eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:45.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I now know when X-Day is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's March 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:52.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}11 days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to make up with Hinazuki first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.96,0:08:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? She's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.25,0:08:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuuki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You seem to have made l-lots of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:27.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's 23 years old at this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}which means he's younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.69,0:08:34.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I owe it all to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:39.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's all because y-you worked up the courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.05,0:08:44.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-When you want to have fun with people,\Nth-they usually get the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}His stammering and gentle nature\Nare just how I remember. He's a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuuki-san, do you know Hinazuki Kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:55.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo-chan? Yeah, I know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The girl who's always at the park by herself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:02.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've talked to her a bunch of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you two classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.93,0:09:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep.\NOh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jun! Let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You go ahead. I'll eat later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a bit early for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.98,0:09:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We start really early in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:19.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I work at my dad's catering service from 4 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,4 a.m.? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Only until noon, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:24.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:29.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since I always saw him hanging around in\Nthe afternoon, I just assumed he was unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:35.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that I'm 29, I can tell he's making an effort\Nto use standard Japanese in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.21,0:09:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kids tend to find this manner\Nof speech credible and mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.05,0:09:43.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did he talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:45.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did it give you the impression he was a nice guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:51.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They put out a papercraft\Ntournament special recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:59.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Uh, I-I got those from someone,\Ns-so I couldn't th-throw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It doesn't bother me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:05.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was there anything in his room\Nthat made you feel uneasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.27,0:10:12.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I should get going.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:20.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satoru-kun, you've matured quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.01,0:10:22.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:33.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shiratori Jun.\N{\i1}In May 2006, he's sitting on death row.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}He's maintained his innocence ever since the initial hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really can't believe that\NYuuki-san would murder anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If no crimes take place, there won't be any suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:49.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just you wait, Yuuki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I swear I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:58.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's still not home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:05.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This place is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:12.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gloves!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:17.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:28.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Close the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No! If you stay here...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:46.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You cooped in here by yourself again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:48.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bitch...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:50.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get in the house, quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.38,0:12:05.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.45,0:12:07.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did she get those bruises?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:13.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell him, Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.76,0:12:29.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I couldn't find the words \Nto respond to Hinazuki's sad lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:35.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her eyes wouldn't look my way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kayo. Cool it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:13:00.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you don't get that face\Nof yours healed by Monday,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll get all the blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.98,0:13:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave some ice for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:29.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's not here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:36.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning, Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.11,0:13:37.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:41.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's how you calculate the radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:47.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The circumference is the diameter multiplied by pi,{literally says 3.14 but eh}{i'm too pedantic for this shit}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:50.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so if you divide by pi instead,\Nyou'll get the diameter,{is this sentence awkwardly long?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which you can divide by two...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:55.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hinazuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.65,0:13:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Take your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, who wants to come up here and solve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about you, Satou?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.95,0:14:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:18.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're collecting the school lunch money!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.05,0:14:21.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}I have to change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.53,0:14:21.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put it in this box.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you forgot to bring yours today,\Nyou have until tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The reason Kayo's often late\Nor absent on Mondays, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have an idea, Satoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.09,0:14:35.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because her mother beats her on Saturdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:38.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.95,0:14:42.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.98,0:14:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.51,0:14:47.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if I should\Ntell the other students or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know how Kayo's cut off\Nfrom the rest of the class, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they find out she's being abused on top of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:56.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,everyone might discriminate against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:14:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Satoru, I know you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.68,0:15:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.31,0:15:06.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep it a secret from the others.\NGot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, we started suspecting\NKayo's mother around May last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:15.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But as of now, no concrete steps\Nhave been taken to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.43,0:15:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her mother ends up covering it up well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Child Welfare Center has visited\Nthem three times as of last month,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but she has good intuition, because each time they came, she was out with Kayo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They haven't been able to question them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:33.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Useless hacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:34.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I said that out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:38.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've met the mother a few times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:41.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo's definitely being abused.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All we need is confirmation\Nfrom the Child Welfare Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.87,0:15:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll free Kayo from her mother as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Their preparations are that far along, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.53,0:15:53.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if and when that happens,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.73,0:15:56.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo won't be in this class anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:15:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as Hinazuki is saved, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.86,0:16:00.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:05.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yashiro must be waiting\Nfor spring break to take action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it'll be too late by then!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:11.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Step on it, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:15.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit down already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.46,0:16:16.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The lunch money is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}29 years old and I've gotta \Nget caught up in something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.61,0:16:27.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:28.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:32.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I lost everyone's lunch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think he lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:38.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody must've stolen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like Hinazuki-san, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:43.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait. What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, she hasn't paid for her lunches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure only someone\Nwho's poor would steal the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:52.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's probably right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:54.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you take it, Hinazuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:55.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goddamn brat...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:17:00.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll find out once we check everyone's bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, I wanna eat already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:07.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you gonna look{search} for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.51,0:17:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why bother? I didn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.44,0:17:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Search your neighbors' bags, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:14.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You took it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.39,0:17:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:17.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, find the thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be Hinazuki, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.52,0:17:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:24.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was Hinazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.74,0:17:26.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It was someone who's poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:30.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kayo's the thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}See? I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:30.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what if she's poor or starving?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.97,0:17:35.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hinazuki would never steal from anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I bet it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, anybody could've taken it\N from Satoru's desk and planted it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Class, Kayo's on duty today, so there's \Nnothing strange about her having the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:59.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Misato, Satoru. This ends here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's have lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.64,0:18:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,School will be closing shortly...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, this is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.49,0:18:13.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for earlier, Fujinuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.\NShe was saying some really awful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:22.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we were in third grade, \Nshe kept making fun of my pencils.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:25.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I threw her prized\Nmechanical pencil out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's hated me ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though the feeling's mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:37.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this one time, \Nshe invited me to a Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:40.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She just wanted to show off her big Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.28,0:18:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:50.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about we go see one today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.29,0:18:53.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.77,0:18:58.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.49,0:19:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're just cotton gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:09.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we're going up a hill, so it'll be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.12,0:19:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never said I'd go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:24.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I used to ski and bobsled here all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:29.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even saw red foxes every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.77,0:19:38.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There they are!{*shine noise*}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.51,0:19:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I remembered the red foxes circling around my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I saw them by myself 18 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.09,0:19:52.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobody believed me when I told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.33,0:20:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think they're a couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:05.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:17.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm in luck today.\N{\i1}The clouds have cleared up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:43.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.21,0:20:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid? It's February.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's come back here in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To see this Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?
